== Strategy ==
* The '''Rocket Toilet''' is a very fast and high health enemy, so you should always be prepared when it comes.
* Because of its speed, it is very hard to defeat, so you should use some units to slow it down. These units are [[Mech Cameraman]], [[TV Woman]], and [[Upgraded Titan Cameraman]] Levels 5/6.
* It also has a lot of health, so you should use a high DPS unit such as [[Jetpack Cameraman]].

== Trivia ==
* It is based off of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Giant_Rocket_Skibidi_Toilet Giant Rocket Skibidi Toilet] from the series.
* Despite having rockets, it does not explode nor stun units. However, it heavily damaged the Titan Cameraman in the series by exploding on him.
* Gets replaced by [[Airplane Toilet]] in the later waves.
* One thing to note that in the actual series there are 6 rockets but in the game there is 4 rockets.

